{"title":"Why it matters · Kormik","styles":"\n    .sc-placeholder{background:color-mix(in srgb,currentColor 8%,transparent);\n      border:1px solid color-mix(in srgb,currentColor 50%,transparent);\n      border-radius:2px;box-sizing:border-box;overflow:hidden}\n    @keyframes sc-shine{0%{background-position:100% 50%}100%{background-position:0% 50%}}\n    html.sc-dc-streaming .sc-placeholder,\n    html.sc-dc-streaming .sc-interp.sc-missing{position:relative;\n      background:color-mix(in srgb,currentColor 5%,transparent);\n      border-color:transparent}\n    html.sc-dc-streaming .sc-placeholder::before,\n    html.sc-dc-streaming .sc-interp.sc-missing::before{content:'';\n      position:absolute;inset:0;pointer-events:none;\n      background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(217,119,87,0) 25%,rgba(247,225,211,.95) 37%,rgba(217,119,87,0) 63%);\n      background-size:400% 100%;animation:sc-shine 1.4s ease infinite}\n    html.sc-dc-streaming .sc-placeholder:nth-child(n+9 of .sc-placeholder)::before,\n    html.sc-dc-streaming .sc-interp.sc-missing:nth-child(n+9 of .sc-interp.sc-missing)::before{animation:none;\n      background:color-mix(in srgb,currentColor 8%,transparent)}\n    .sc-placeholder-error{padding:4px 8px;font:11px/1.4 ui-monospace,monospace;\n      color:color-mix(in srgb,currentColor 70%,transparent);word-break:break-word}\n    .sc-interp.sc-missing{display:inline-block;width:2em;height:1em;overflow:hidden;\n      vertical-align:text-bottom;background:rgba(255,255,255,.3);border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,.5);\n      border-radius:2px;box-sizing:border-box;color:transparent;\n      user-select:none}\n    .sc-interp.sc-unresolved{font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:.85em;\n      color:color-mix(in srgb,currentColor 50%,transparent);\n      background:color-mix(in srgb,currentColor 10%,transparent);border-radius:3px;\n      padding:0 3px}\n    .sc-host.sc-has-error{position:relative}\n    .sc-logic-error{position:absolute;top:8px;left:8px;z-index:2147483647;max-width:60ch;\n      padding:6px 10px;background:#b00020;color:#fff;font:12px/1.4 ui-monospace,monospace;\n      border-radius:4px;white-space:pre-wrap;pointer-events:none}\n    /* Mirrors PRINT_BASELINE_CSS in apps/web deck-stage-export.ts — keep both\n       in sync until dc-runtime regains a build step. */\n    @media print {\n      @page { margin: 0.5cm; }\n      figure, table { break-inside: avoid; }\n      #dc-root, #dc-root > .sc-host { height: auto; }\n      *, *::before, *::after {\n        print-color-adjust: exact; -webkit-print-color-adjust: exact;\n        backdrop-filter: none !important; -webkit-backdrop-filter: none !important;\n        animation-delay: -99s !important; animation-duration: .001s !important;\n        animation-iteration-count: 1 !important; animation-fill-mode: both !important;\n        animation-play-state: running !important; transition-duration: 0s !important;\n      }\n    }\n  \n/* ---- */\nx-dc{display:none!important}\n/* ---- */\nhtml,body{height:100%;margin:0}#dc-root,#dc-root>.sc-host{height:100%}\n/* ---- */\n\n    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }\n    body { margin: 0; background: var(--paper); }\n    a { color: var(--indigo); text-decoration-color: var(--orange); }\n    a:hover { color: var(--indigo); }\n    @media (max-width: 768px) { .k-nav__menu, .k-lang__opt, .k-chip { min-height: 44px; } .k-btn--link { min-height: 44px; display: inline-flex; } }\n  ","html":"<div class=\"sc-host\" data-sc-name=\"Why it matters\"><div class=\"sc-host-x\" data-dc-tpl=\"12\" style=\"display: contents;\"><header class=\"k-nav\" data-theme=\"light\"><div class=\"k-nav__inner\"><a href=\"Home.dc.html\" class=\"k-nav__logo\"><img src=\"assets/logos/kormik-lockup-orange-indigo.png\" alt=\"Kormik\" height=\"40\"></a><nav class=\"k-nav__links\" aria-label=\"Main\"><a href=\"Home.dc.html\" class=\"k-nav__link\">Home</a><a href=\"Why it matters.dc.html\" class=\"k-nav__link is-active\" aria-current=\"page\">Why it matters</a><a href=\"For clients.dc.html\" class=\"k-nav__link\">For clients</a><a href=\"Approach.dc.html\" class=\"k-nav__link\">Approach</a><a href=\"About.dc.html\" class=\"k-nav__link\">About</a><a href=\"Join.dc.html\" class=\"k-nav__link\">Join</a></nav><div class=\"k-nav__end\"><div class=\"k-lang\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Language\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"k-lang__opt is-active\" aria-pressed=\"true\">EN</button><button type=\"button\" lang=\"bn\" class=\"k-lang__opt\" aria-pressed=\"false\">বাং</button></div><a href=\"Join.dc.html\" class=\"k-btn k-btn--primary k-btn--sm\">Get early access</a><button type=\"button\" class=\"k-nav__menu\" aria-expanded=\"false\">Menu</button></div></div></header></div><main data-dc-tpl=\"13\"><section data-dc-tpl=\"14\" data-theme=\"indigo\" data-screen-label=\"Hero\" style=\"background: var(--indigo); color: rgb(255, 255, 255); padding-block: 64px; overflow: hidden;\">\n  <div data-dc-tpl=\"15\" class=\"k-container\">\n    <div data-dc-tpl=\"16\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr)); gap: 40px 56px; align-items: center;\">\n      <div data-dc-tpl=\"17\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 20px; min-width: 0px;\">\n        <p data-dc-tpl=\"18\" class=\"label\" style=\"margin: 0px; color: var(--lavender);\">Why it matters</p>\n        <h1 data-dc-tpl=\"19\" style=\"margin: 0px; font: 700 clamp(34px, 3.6vw, 52px) / 1.08 Ubuntu, &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1.2px; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Every morning, a lottery. <span data-dc-tpl=\"20\" style=\"color: var(--orange);\">Every workday, unrecorded.</span></h1>\n        <p data-dc-tpl=\"21\" class=\"body-lg\" style=\"margin: 0px; color: var(--lavender); max-width: 50ch;\">A worker in Bangladesh faces two injustices. The first is getting the work. The second is proving they did it.</p>\n        <div data-dc-tpl=\"22\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px; padding-top: 4px;\">\n          <div class=\"sc-host-x\" data-dc-tpl=\"23\" style=\"display: contents;\"><a href=\"Join.dc.html\" class=\"k-btn k-btn--primary k-btn--lg\">Join early access<span class=\"k-btn__arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></a></div>\n          <div class=\"sc-host-x\" data-dc-tpl=\"24\" style=\"display: contents;\"><a href=\"#chain\" class=\"k-btn k-btn--secondary k-btn--lg\">How work reaches a worker</a></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div data-dc-tpl=\"25\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 4 / 3; border-radius: 4px; overflow: hidden; background: var(--indigo-2); min-width: 0px;\">\n        <img data-dc-tpl=\"26\" src=\"assets/work-crowd.jpg\" alt=\"Workers behind a bamboo barrier, waiting to be picked for the day\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; object-position: center 40%; display: block;\">\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div></section><section data-dc-tpl=\"27\" data-theme=\"light\" data-screen-label=\"Scale\" style=\"background: var(--paper); padding-block: 80px;\">\n  <div data-dc-tpl=\"28\" class=\"k-container\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; text-align: center; gap: 16px;\">\n    <p data-dc-tpl=\"29\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant: tabular-nums; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-weight: 700; font-stretch: normal; font-size: clamp(120px, 16vw, 220px); line-height: 0.9; font-family: Ubuntu, &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -8px; color: var(--indigo);\">84<span data-dc-tpl=\"30\" style=\"color: var(--orange);\">%</span></p>\n    <p data-dc-tpl=\"31\" class=\"body-lg\" style=\"margin: 0px; color: var(--ink);\">of employed people in Bangladesh work informally. About 5.8 crore people.</p>\n    <p data-dc-tpl=\"32\" class=\"small\" style=\"margin: 0px; color: var(--ink-muted);\">BBS Labour Force Survey 2024</p>\n    <h2 data-dc-tpl=\"33\" style=\"margin: 24px 0px 0px; font: 700 clamp(28px, 2.8vw, 40px) / 1.12 Ubuntu, &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1px; color: var(--indigo);\">This is not the edge of Bangladesh's economy. It is most of it.</h2>\n  </div></section><section data-dc-tpl=\"34\" data-theme=\"light\" data-screen-label=\"Two injustices\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); padding-block: 80px;\">\n  <div data-dc-tpl=\"35\" class=\"k-container\">\n    <h2 data-dc-tpl=\"36\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 40px; font: 700 clamp(30px, 3vw, 42px) / 1.1 Ubuntu, &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1px; color: var(--indigo); text-align: center;\">Two injustices, every day.</h2>\n    <div data-dc-tpl=\"37\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr)); gap: 32px 40px; align-items: stretch;\">\n      <div data-dc-tpl=\"38\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px; border-top: 2px solid var(--indigo); padding-top: 20px;\">\n        <p data-dc-tpl=\"39\" class=\"label\" style=\"margin: 0px; color: var(--orange-ink);\">One</p>\n        <h3 data-dc-tpl=\"40\" class=\"heading-3\" style=\"margin: 0px; color: var(--indigo);\">Getting the work</h3>\n        <p data-dc-tpl=\"41\" class=\"body\" style=\"margin: 0px; color: var(--ink-muted);\">At dawn, at the roadside, workers wait to be picked. Some are chosen. The rest go home with nothing, and try again tomorrow.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div data-dc-tpl=\"42\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 3 / 4; border-radius: 4px; overflow: hidden; background: var(--slot); max-height: 420px; justify-self: center; width: 100%;\">\n        <img data-dc-tpl=\"43\" src=\"assets/work-portrait.jpg\" alt=\"A worker walking to work with a spade over his shoulder\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; object-position: 50% 30%; display: block;\">\n      </div>\n      <div data-dc-tpl=\"44\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px; border-top: 2px solid var(--orange); padding-top: 20px;\">\n        <p data-dc-tpl=\"45\" class=\"label\" style=\"margin: 0px; color: var(--orange-ink);\">Two</p>\n        <h3 data-dc-tpl=\"46\" class=\"heading-3\" style=\"margin: 0px; color: var(--indigo);\">Proving they did it</h3>\n        <p data-dc-tpl=\"47\" class=\"body\" style=\"margin: 0px; color: var(--ink-muted);\">Cash in hand. No slip, no name, no date. The money changes hands. The proof never does.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div></section><section data-dc-tpl=\"48\" data-theme=\"indigo\" data-screen-label=\"Without a record\" style=\"background: var(--indigo-deep); color: rgb(255, 255, 255); padding-block: 80px;\">\n  <div data-dc-tpl=\"49\" class=\"k-container\">\n    <h2 data-dc-tpl=\"50\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 40px; font: 700 clamp(30px, 3vw, 42px) / 1.1 Ubuntu, &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1px; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: center;\">Without a record, a worker can't…</h2>\n    <div data-dc-tpl=\"51\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr)); gap: 28px 32px;\">\n      <div data-dc-tpl=\"52\" style=\"border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2); padding-top: 18px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px;\"><h3 data-dc-tpl=\"53\" class=\"heading-4\" style=\"margin: 0px; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 24px;\">contest a wage</h3><p data-dc-tpl=\"54\" class=\"body\" style=\"margin: 0px; color: var(--lavender);\">When the pay comes short, there is nothing to point to.</p></div>\n      <div data-dc-tpl=\"55\" style=\"border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2); padding-top: 18px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px;\"><h3 data-dc-tpl=\"56\" class=\"heading-4\" style=\"margin: 0px; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 24px;\">show their experience</h3><p data-dc-tpl=\"57\" class=\"body\" style=\"margin: 0px; color: var(--lavender);\">Ten years of work look the same as none.</p></div>\n      <div data-dc-tpl=\"58\" style=\"border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2); padding-top: 18px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px;\"><h3 data-dc-tpl=\"59\" class=\"heading-4\" style=\"margin: 0px; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 24px;\">prove they were at work when they got hurt</h3><p data-dc-tpl=\"60\" class=\"body\" style=\"margin: 0px; color: var(--lavender);\">9.6 lakh people reported a work injury or illness in one year.</p><p data-dc-tpl=\"61\" class=\"small\" style=\"margin: 0px; color: var(--lavender-dim);\">BBS Labour Force Survey 2024</p></div>\n    </div>\n    <div data-dc-tpl=\"62\" style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 20px; margin-top: 48px; flex-wrap: wrap; text-align: center;\">\n      <div data-dc-tpl=\"63\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"width: 40px; aspect-ratio: 502 / 689; background: var(--orange); mask-image: url(&quot;assets/fingerprint.png&quot;); mask-size: contain; mask-repeat: no-repeat;\"></div>\n      <p data-dc-tpl=\"64\" style=\"margin: 0px; font: 500 clamp(20px, 1.8vw, 26px) / 1.3 Ubuntu, &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, sans-serif; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">And the country can't count, reach or protect them.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div></section><section data-dc-tpl=\"65\" id=\"chain\" data-theme=\"light\" data-screen-label=\"How work reaches a worker\" style=\"background: var(--paper); padding-block: 80px;\">\n  <div data-dc-tpl=\"66\" class=\"k-container\">\n    <h2 data-dc-tpl=\"67\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 12px; font: 700 clamp(30px, 3vw, 42px) / 1.1 Ubuntu, &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1px; color: var(--indigo); text-align: center;\">How work reaches a worker today</h2>\n    <p data-dc-tpl=\"68\" class=\"body-lg\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 40px; color: var(--ink-muted); text-align: center;\">Five links, from the first order to the day's work. Only the last one is left with nothing.</p>\n    <ol data-dc-tpl=\"69\" style=\"list-style: none; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(180px, 1fr)); gap: 24px 16px;\">\n      <li data-dc-tpl=\"70\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px;\"><div data-dc-tpl=\"71\" style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;\"><span data-dc-tpl=\"72\" style=\"width: 36px; height: 36px; border-radius: 999px; border: 2px solid var(--indigo); display: grid; place-items: center; font: 700 15px / 1 Ubuntu, sans-serif; color: var(--indigo); flex: 0 0 auto;\">1</span><span data-dc-tpl=\"73\" style=\"flex: 1 1 0%; border-top: 2px solid var(--indigo);\"></span></div><h3 data-dc-tpl=\"74\" class=\"heading-4\" style=\"margin: 0px; color: var(--indigo); font-size: 20px;\">Government bodies and large firms</h3><p data-dc-tpl=\"75\" class=\"body\" style=\"margin: 0px; color: var(--ink-muted);\">issue the work.</p></li>\n      <li data-dc-tpl=\"76\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px;\"><div data-dc-tpl=\"77\" style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;\"><span data-dc-tpl=\"78\" style=\"width: 36px; height: 36px; border-radius: 999px; border: 2px solid var(--indigo); display: grid; place-items: center; font: 700 15px / 1 Ubuntu, sans-serif; color: var(--indigo); flex: 0 0 auto;\">2</span><span data-dc-tpl=\"79\" style=\"flex: 1 1 0%; border-top: 2px solid var(--indigo);\"></span></div><h3 data-dc-tpl=\"80\" class=\"heading-4\" style=\"margin: 0px; color: var(--indigo); font-size: 20px;\">Licensed firms</h3><p data-dc-tpl=\"81\" class=\"body\" style=\"margin: 0px; color: var(--ink-muted);\">bid for the tenders.</p></li>\n      <li data-dc-tpl=\"82\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px;\"><div data-dc-tpl=\"83\" style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;\"><span data-dc-tpl=\"84\" style=\"width: 36px; height: 36px; border-radius: 999px; border: 2px solid var(--indigo); display: grid; place-items: center; font: 700 15px / 1 Ubuntu, sans-serif; color: var(--indigo); flex: 0 0 auto;\">3</span><span data-dc-tpl=\"85\" style=\"flex: 1 1 0%; border-top: 2px solid var(--indigo);\"></span></div><h3 data-dc-tpl=\"86\" class=\"heading-4\" style=\"margin: 0px; color: var(--indigo); font-size: 20px;\">Contractors, sub-contractors and households</h3><p data-dc-tpl=\"87\" class=\"body\" style=\"margin: 0px; color: var(--ink-muted);\">hire for the job.</p></li>\n      <li data-dc-tpl=\"88\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px;\"><div data-dc-tpl=\"89\" style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;\"><span data-dc-tpl=\"90\" style=\"width: 36px; height: 36px; border-radius: 999px; border: 2px solid var(--indigo); display: grid; place-items: center; font: 700 15px / 1 Ubuntu, sans-serif; color: var(--indigo); flex: 0 0 auto;\">4</span><span data-dc-tpl=\"91\" style=\"flex: 1 1 0%; border-top: 2px dashed var(--orange);\"></span></div><h3 data-dc-tpl=\"92\" class=\"heading-4\" style=\"margin: 0px; color: var(--indigo); font-size: 20px;\">A broker or sardar</h3><p data-dc-tpl=\"93\" class=\"body\" style=\"margin: 0px; color: var(--ink-muted);\">puts the crew together.</p></li>\n      <li data-dc-tpl=\"94\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px;\"><div data-dc-tpl=\"95\" style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;\"><span data-dc-tpl=\"96\" style=\"width: 36px; height: 36px; border-radius: 999px; background: var(--orange); display: grid; place-items: center; font: 700 15px / 1 Ubuntu, sans-serif; color: var(--indigo); flex: 0 0 auto;\">5</span></div><h3 data-dc-tpl=\"97\" class=\"heading-4\" style=\"margin: 0px; color: var(--indigo); font-size: 20px;\">The worker</h3><p data-dc-tpl=\"98\" class=\"body\" style=\"margin: 0px; color: var(--ink);\">is picked at dawn, paid in cash, and left with no record.</p></li>\n    </ol>\n  </div></section><section data-dc-tpl=\"99\" data-theme=\"light\" data-screen-label=\"Who carries the most risk\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); padding-block: 80px;\">\n  <div data-dc-tpl=\"100\" class=\"k-container\">\n    <h2 data-dc-tpl=\"101\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 40px; font: 700 clamp(30px, 3vw, 42px) / 1.1 Ubuntu, &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1px; color: var(--indigo); text-align: center;\">Who carries the most risk</h2>\n    <div data-dc-tpl=\"102\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 32px;\">\n      <div data-dc-tpl=\"103\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px;\">\n        <div data-dc-tpl=\"104\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 4 / 3; border-radius: 4px; overflow: hidden; background: var(--slot);\"><img data-dc-tpl=\"105\" src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1591260315238-79ee54d55fc5?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=700&amp;q=70\" alt=\"A woman worker on a building site\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; display: block;\"></div>\n        <h3 data-dc-tpl=\"106\" class=\"heading-3\" style=\"margin: 0px; color: var(--indigo);\">Women</h3>\n        <div data-dc-tpl=\"107\" style=\"display: flex; gap: 28px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n          <div data-dc-tpl=\"108\"><p data-dc-tpl=\"109\" style=\"margin: 0px; font: 700 36px / 1 Ubuntu, sans-serif; color: var(--indigo); letter-spacing: -1px;\">96%</p><p data-dc-tpl=\"110\" class=\"small\" style=\"margin: 4px 0px 0px; color: var(--ink);\">of employed women work informally</p></div>\n          <div data-dc-tpl=\"111\"><p data-dc-tpl=\"112\" style=\"margin: 0px; font: 700 36px / 1 Ubuntu, sans-serif; color: var(--indigo); letter-spacing: -1px;\">57%</p><p data-dc-tpl=\"113\" class=\"small\" style=\"margin: 4px 0px 0px; color: var(--ink);\">of men's pay, in elementary jobs</p></div>\n        </div>\n        <p data-dc-tpl=\"114\" class=\"small\" style=\"margin: 0px; color: var(--ink-muted);\">BBS Labour Force Survey 2024</p>\n      </div>\n      <div data-dc-tpl=\"115\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px;\">\n        <div data-dc-tpl=\"116\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 4 / 3; border-radius: 4px; overflow: hidden; background: var(--slot);\"><img data-dc-tpl=\"117\" src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1616610269931-04d58b579ddf?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=700&amp;q=70\" alt=\"A labourer working outdoors in the heat\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; display: block;\"></div>\n        <h3 data-dc-tpl=\"118\" class=\"heading-3\" style=\"margin: 0px; color: var(--indigo);\">Outdoor workers</h3>\n        <p data-dc-tpl=\"119\" class=\"body\" style=\"margin: 0px; color: var(--ink-muted);\">On roads, roofs and sites through the heat and the monsoon. When the weather stops the work, the day's pay stops with it.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div data-dc-tpl=\"120\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px;\">\n        <div data-dc-tpl=\"121\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 4 / 3; border-radius: 4px; overflow: hidden; background: var(--slot);\"><img data-dc-tpl=\"122\" src=\"assets/work-elder.jpg\" alt=\"An older worker among a crowd, newly arrived in the city\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; object-position: 50% 45%; display: block;\"></div>\n        <h3 data-dc-tpl=\"123\" class=\"heading-3\" style=\"margin: 0px; color: var(--indigo);\">Seasonal workers</h3>\n        <p data-dc-tpl=\"124\" class=\"body\" style=\"margin: 0px; color: var(--ink-muted);\">New to the city between harvests, with no one to vouch for them and nothing to show for the work they have done before.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div></section><section data-dc-tpl=\"125\" data-theme=\"light\" data-screen-label=\"More figures\" style=\"background: var(--paper); padding-block: 72px;\">\n  <div data-dc-tpl=\"126\" class=\"k-container\">\n    <h2 data-dc-tpl=\"127\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 32px; font: 700 clamp(26px, 2.4vw, 34px) / 1.15 Ubuntu, &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.8px; color: var(--indigo); text-align: center;\">The rest of the picture</h2>\n    <div data-dc-tpl=\"128\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr)); gap: 0px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line);\">\n      <div data-dc-tpl=\"129\" style=\"padding: 20px 20px 20px 0px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);\"><p data-dc-tpl=\"130\" style=\"margin: 0px; font: 700 32px / 1 Ubuntu, sans-serif; color: var(--indigo); letter-spacing: -1px;\">3 in 4</p><p data-dc-tpl=\"131\" class=\"body\" style=\"margin: 8px 0px 4px; color: var(--ink);\">wage earners are paid only in cash</p><p data-dc-tpl=\"132\" class=\"small\" style=\"margin: 0px; color: var(--ink-muted);\">World Bank Global Findex 2025</p></div>\n      <div data-dc-tpl=\"133\" style=\"padding: 20px 20px 20px 0px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);\"><p data-dc-tpl=\"134\" style=\"margin: 0px; font: 700 32px / 1 Ubuntu, sans-serif; color: var(--indigo); letter-spacing: -1px;\">1 in 3</p><p data-dc-tpl=\"135\" class=\"body\" style=\"margin: 8px 0px 4px; color: var(--ink);\">paid employees have only a spoken agreement</p><p data-dc-tpl=\"136\" class=\"small\" style=\"margin: 0px; color: var(--ink-muted);\">BBS Labour Force Survey 2024</p></div>\n      <div data-dc-tpl=\"137\" style=\"padding: 20px 20px 20px 0px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);\"><p data-dc-tpl=\"138\" style=\"margin: 0px; font: 700 32px / 1 Ubuntu, sans-serif; color: var(--indigo); letter-spacing: -1px;\">1 in 10</p><p data-dc-tpl=\"139\" class=\"body\" style=\"margin: 8px 0px 4px; color: var(--ink);\">paid employees has an employer paying into a pension</p><p data-dc-tpl=\"140\" class=\"small\" style=\"margin: 0px; color: var(--ink-muted);\">BBS Labour Force Survey 2024</p></div>\n      <div data-dc-tpl=\"141\" style=\"padding: 20px 20px 20px 0px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);\"><p data-dc-tpl=\"142\" style=\"margin: 0px; font: 700 32px / 1 Ubuntu, sans-serif; color: var(--indigo); letter-spacing: -1px;\">37 lakh</p><p data-dc-tpl=\"143\" class=\"body\" style=\"margin: 8px 0px 4px; color: var(--ink);\">people work in construction</p><p data-dc-tpl=\"144\" class=\"small\" style=\"margin: 0px; color: var(--ink-muted);\">BBS Labour Force Survey 2024</p></div>\n      <div data-dc-tpl=\"145\" style=\"padding: 20px 20px 20px 0px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);\"><p data-dc-tpl=\"146\" style=\"margin: 0px; font: 700 32px / 1 Ubuntu, sans-serif; color: var(--indigo); letter-spacing: -1px;\">9% lower</p><p data-dc-tpl=\"147\" class=\"body\" style=\"margin: 8px 0px 4px; color: var(--ink);\">real construction wages than in 2021-22</p><p data-dc-tpl=\"148\" class=\"small\" style=\"margin: 0px; color: var(--ink-muted);\">BBS Wage Rate Index, inflation-adjusted</p></div>\n    </div>\n  </div></section><section data-dc-tpl=\"149\" data-theme=\"indigo\" data-screen-label=\"SDGs\" style=\"background: var(--indigo); color: rgb(255, 255, 255); padding-block: 80px;\">\n  <div data-dc-tpl=\"150\" class=\"k-container\">\n    <h2 data-dc-tpl=\"151\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 12px; font: 700 clamp(30px, 3vw, 42px) / 1.1 Ubuntu, &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1px; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: center;\">Why it matters for Bangladesh</h2>\n    <p data-dc-tpl=\"152\" class=\"body-lg\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 40px; color: var(--lavender); text-align: center;\">What recorded work can change, goal by goal.</p>\n    <div data-dc-tpl=\"153\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr)); gap: 28px 24px;\">\n      <div data-dc-tpl=\"154\" style=\"border-top: 2px solid var(--orange); padding-top: 16px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px;\"><p data-dc-tpl=\"155\" style=\"margin: 0px; font: 700 40px / 1 Ubuntu, sans-serif; color: var(--orange);\">1</p><h3 data-dc-tpl=\"156\" class=\"heading-4\" style=\"margin: 0px; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 20px;\">No poverty</h3><p data-dc-tpl=\"157\" class=\"body\" style=\"margin: 0px; color: var(--lavender);\">A record of steady work can open the door to credit and support.</p></div>\n      <div data-dc-tpl=\"158\" style=\"border-top: 2px solid var(--orange); padding-top: 16px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px;\"><p data-dc-tpl=\"159\" style=\"margin: 0px; font: 700 40px / 1 Ubuntu, sans-serif; color: var(--orange);\">5</p><h3 data-dc-tpl=\"160\" class=\"heading-4\" style=\"margin: 0px; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 20px;\">Gender equality</h3><p data-dc-tpl=\"161\" class=\"body\" style=\"margin: 0px; color: var(--lavender);\">Women's work, counted in their own name, is harder to underpay.</p></div>\n      <div data-dc-tpl=\"162\" style=\"border-top: 2px solid var(--orange); padding-top: 16px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px;\"><p data-dc-tpl=\"163\" style=\"margin: 0px; font: 700 40px / 1 Ubuntu, sans-serif; color: var(--orange);\">8</p><h3 data-dc-tpl=\"164\" class=\"heading-4\" style=\"margin: 0px; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 20px;\">Decent work</h3><p data-dc-tpl=\"165\" class=\"body\" style=\"margin: 0px; color: var(--lavender);\">Proof of each day makes fair pay and safe sites something to stand on.</p></div>\n      <div data-dc-tpl=\"166\" style=\"border-top: 2px solid var(--orange); padding-top: 16px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px;\"><p data-dc-tpl=\"167\" style=\"margin: 0px; font: 700 40px / 1 Ubuntu, sans-serif; color: var(--orange);\">9</p><h3 data-dc-tpl=\"168\" class=\"heading-4\" style=\"margin: 0px; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 20px;\">Industry and infrastructure</h3><p data-dc-tpl=\"169\" class=\"body\" style=\"margin: 0px; color: var(--lavender);\">Roads and buildings with a clear record of who built them.</p></div>\n      <div data-dc-tpl=\"170\" style=\"border-top: 2px solid var(--orange); padding-top: 16px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px;\"><p data-dc-tpl=\"171\" style=\"margin: 0px; font: 700 40px / 1 Ubuntu, sans-serif; color: var(--orange);\">10</p><h3 data-dc-tpl=\"172\" class=\"heading-4\" style=\"margin: 0px; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 20px;\">Reduced inequalities</h3><p data-dc-tpl=\"173\" class=\"body\" style=\"margin: 0px; color: var(--lavender);\">Workers the country can count are workers it can reach.</p></div>\n    </div>\n  </div></section><section data-dc-tpl=\"174\" data-theme=\"light\" data-screen-label=\"Sources and CTA\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); padding-block: 72px;\">\n  <div data-dc-tpl=\"175\" class=\"k-container\">\n    <div data-dc-tpl=\"176\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr)); gap: 40px 64px; align-items: start;\">\n      <div data-dc-tpl=\"177\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px;\">\n        <h2 data-dc-tpl=\"178\" class=\"heading-4\" style=\"margin: 0px; color: var(--indigo);\">Sources</h2>\n        <ul data-dc-tpl=\"179\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding-left: 18px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px;\">\n          <li data-dc-tpl=\"180\" class=\"body\" style=\"color: var(--ink);\">Bangladesh Bureau of Statistics, Labour Force Survey 2024</li>\n          <li data-dc-tpl=\"181\" class=\"body\" style=\"color: var(--ink);\">Bangladesh Bureau of Statistics, Wage Rate Index (inflation-adjusted)</li>\n          <li data-dc-tpl=\"182\" class=\"body\" style=\"color: var(--ink);\">World Bank, Global Findex Database 2025</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div>\n      <div data-dc-tpl=\"183\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 16px;\">\n        <h2 data-dc-tpl=\"184\" style=\"margin: 0px; font: 700 clamp(26px, 2.4vw, 34px) / 1.15 Ubuntu, &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.8px; color: var(--indigo);\">Help put the work on record.</h2>\n        <div data-dc-tpl=\"185\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px;\">\n          <div class=\"sc-host-x\" data-dc-tpl=\"186\" style=\"display: contents;\"><a href=\"Join.dc.html\" class=\"k-btn k-btn--primary k-btn--md\">Join early access<span class=\"k-btn__arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></a></div>\n          <div class=\"sc-host-x\" data-dc-tpl=\"187\" style=\"display: contents;\"><a href=\"For clients.dc.html\" class=\"k-btn k-btn--secondary k-btn--md\">For clients<span class=\"k-btn__arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></a></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div></section></main><div class=\"sc-host-x\" data-dc-tpl=\"188\" style=\"display: contents;\"><footer class=\"k-footer\" data-theme=\"indigo\"><div class=\"k-container\"><div class=\"k-footer__top\"><div class=\"k-footer__brand\"><img src=\"assets/logos/kormik-lockup-white.png\" alt=\"Kormik\" height=\"36\"><p class=\"k-footer__tag\">A record that's yours. Every day of informal work in Bangladesh, recognised, paid and protected.</p></div><nav class=\"k-footer__links\" aria-label=\"Footer\"><a href=\"Home.dc.html\">Home</a><a href=\"Why it matters.dc.html\">Why it matters</a><a href=\"For clients.dc.html\">For clients</a><a href=\"Approach.dc.html\">Approach</a><a href=\"About.dc.html\">About</a><a href=\"Join.dc.html\">Join</a></nav></div><div class=\"k-footer__base\"><span>© 2026 Kormik · kormik.com.bd · Pre-launch preview, made in Dhaka. Not yet a live service.</span><span>Figures: BBS Labour Force Survey 2024 · BBS Wage Rate Index · World Bank Global Findex 2025</span></div></div></footer></div></div>","links":["_ds/kormik-design-system-ae88bca0-d24a-43f7-ac25-8d943541474b/tokens/fonts.css","_ds/kormik-design-system-ae88bca0-d24a-43f7-ac25-8d943541474b/tokens/icons.css","_ds/kormik-design-system-ae88bca0-d24a-43f7-ac25-8d943541474b/tokens/colors.css","_ds/kormik-design-system-ae88bca0-d24a-43f7-ac25-8d943541474b/tokens/typography.css","_ds/kormik-design-system-ae88bca0-d24a-43f7-ac25-8d943541474b/tokens/spacing.css","_ds/kormik-design-system-ae88bca0-d24a-43f7-ac25-8d943541474b/tokens/components.css","_ds/kormik-design-system-ae88bca0-d24a-43f7-ac25-8d943541474b/styles.css"]}